The SIEM system generated multiple alerts indicating suspicious activity:
Observed Alerts:
•	Multiple failed login attempts from an external IP
•	Suspicious outbound traffic from the web server
•	Unauthorized FTP access attempts targeting the file server
Identified Threats:
•	Brute-force attack on authentication systems
•	Possible Command-and-Control (C2) communication
